# Netlify-style SPA fallback rewrite. Honored by Netlify and Vercel.
#
# NOT honored by Render's static sites — Render needs the same rewrite
# configured as a service property instead (Dashboard: static site →
# Settings → Redirects/Rewrites → add source "/*", destination
# "/index.html", type "Rewrite"; or via the API: POST
# /v1/services/{id}/routes with {"type":"rewrite","source":"/*",
# "destination":"/index.html"}). Without it, any deep link (e.g.
# /settings, /challenge/:id) 404s directly from the server instead of
# falling through to the SPA. See README's Render deployment section.
/*    /index.html   200
